-2.  **Specify Control Points:** Define a set of control points (knots) $(s_i, c_i, \alpha_i)$. For a 1D TF, $s_i$ are the scalar values, $c_i$ are RGB colors, and $\alpha_i$ are opacity values [S7, S12, unofficial][S14, unofficial].
